e monsters directly, the key is bouncing surrounding weapons with your hockey stick to hit enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, deflecting a molotov spreads fire and burns part of the map. Bouncing a gun makes it fire while spinning through enemies. Choosing the right object at the right time is the key to survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/4b68b6dae966dd2d66f9fe815c9b3bc7.poster.avif?t=1758239854\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/4b68b6dae966dd2d66f9fe815c9b3bc7.webm?t=1758239854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge diverse difficulties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space-like casinos, speakeasy bars, carnivals full of traps and gimmicks\u2026 and each stage brings a new bizarre map and unique threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger monsters, complex patterns, harsher conditions - how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/85e434adc37c9c879f37112ee6a8b1a5.poster.avif?t=1758239854\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/85e434adc37c9c879f37112ee6a8b1a5.webm?t=1758239854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/85e434adc37c9c879f37112ee6a8b1a5.mp4?t=1758239854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bet on your fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, choose: take safe rewards, or throw chips into the roulette for bigger gains. But it doesn\u2019t end there; upgrade and manipulate the roulette to rig probabilities and tilt luck in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguise trickery as fortune, craft your ultimate build, and shake the odds of survival with every choice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/1d0bcf7f66a85e96d95f4729e4c73e16.poster.avif?t=1758239854\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/1d0bcf7f66a85e96d95f4729e4c73e16.webm?t=1758239854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/extras/1d0bcf7f66a85e96d95f4729e4c73e16.mp4?t=1758239854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["SANDY FLOOR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813810/a5e17a18b129e1cf2ca172aae3881e501edd6cc6/header.jpg?t=1758239854","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura 13.0.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1536 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple silicon</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813810/371165506/2d28e87e19a6e22c9cd60394e9812829387b32ac/1757670175/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757677433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813810/371165506/2d28e87e19a6e22c9cd60394e9812829387b32ac/1757670175/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757677433","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3813810/371165506/2d28e8